@startuml
title Sequence Diagram - Reporting

actor Manager
participant "Dashboard UI" as UI
participant "Report API" as Report
database DB

Manager -> UI : select report range
UI -> Report : GET /api/reports?range=...
Report -> DB : query order revenue and product stats
DB --> Report : report rows
Report --> UI : analytics dataset
UI --> Manager : render charts and tables
opt print report
  UI -> Report : request printable output
  Report --> UI : printable report data
end
@enduml
